  "system": {
    "identifier": "forceful-strike",
    "description": "<p>When you deal unarmed damage to a creature as a result of an attack, you can spend 1 Martial Die to force them to make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, they are pushed back a number of feet equal to 5 times the result. Beginning at 7th level, you can spend 2 dice increasing the distance pushed and at 13th level, you can spend 3 dice. If a pushed creatures movement would be stopped by a solid structure or objected, they and the object/structure take 1d6 bludgeoning damage for every 5 feet of movement the affected creature did not move.</p>",
